    "id": "686d5916f9ac2b19628e2783",
    "title": "Employee Spotlight: Scott Berkey",
    "slug": "employee-spotlight-scott-berkey",
    "excerpt": "...",
    "content": "#LifeAtCAPS with Scott Berkey, Family Support Specialist in CAPS' Community Education program\n\n\"Community Education gives me a platform to help parents understand their role in setting healthy boundaries that not only keep their kids safe, but they are also able to put their kids in a position to succeed as a human being and as a citizen. To put it in evangelistic terms, 'how will they know unless someone tells them.\"\n\n\"What do I love the most about this work is when you witness a parent making the connection between how they relate to their kid and how their kid relates to others.\"\n\nFor job opportunities at CAPS, visit our Career Page.",
