    "id": "686d591dd21bf4fa39324a70",
    "title": "Welcome CAPS' New Senior Director of Programs",
    "slug": "welcome-caps-new-senior-director-of-programs",
    "excerpt": "...",
    "content": "CAPS is pleased to welcome Brandie Yoder as the new Senior Director of Programs. She will play an instrumental role in casting vision and guiding program services. Brandie formerly served as a Director at Goshen Health, overseeing multiple departments that included nearly 100 staff. With her degrees in nursing and public health, as well as her work experience, she brings a mixture of professional leadership excellence and personal passion to the role. She will begin on May 8th. Brandie first got to know CAPS through her role as a volunteer in the Court Appointed Special Advocate (CASA) program, advocating for children who experienced abuse or neglect. She shares, CAPS is excited to have Brandie as part of our team!",
