  {
    "id": "686d592cf04dc635589af1bc",
    "title": "Heart of the Holidays: Helping Hands, Hope, and Happiness",
    "slug": "heart-of-the-holidays-helping-hands-hope-and-happiness",
    "excerpt": "...",
    "content": "Bringing Joy to Families: CAPS’ Heart of the Holidays The holidays are a time for joy, giving, and connection, and CAPS’ cherished Heart of the Holidays program captures that spirit perfectly. This impactful initiative brings hope and happiness to families in need by matching generous supporters—businesses, churches, individuals, and families—with families in CAPS programs. Together, they fulfill holiday wishes for essentials like clothing, hygiene products, and food, as well as toys and books for children, creating a season filled with love and cheer. Behind the Magic Leading the charge is Bethani Estes, whose dedication and attention to detail ensure that everything runs seamlessly. From coordinating with donors to managing deadlines, Bethani keeps the program on track while infusing it with heart. “Each year that I coordinate the Heart of the Holidays program, the supporters always amaze me with their generosity,” Bethani shares. “The families who receive these gifts, and the CAPS staff who meet with them, are always so grateful.” Thanks to the community’s outpouring of support, the program is more than just a gift exchange—it’s a testament to the power of kindness. It fosters connection and reminds us that small acts of giving can have a big impact on the lives of others. In the Community Amber Rodriguez from Surf Internet states, \"We love being a part of this program.\" Kara Bauman from Lippert said,  \"We simply feel lucky to be providing for the families.\" A current mother from the CAPS Healthy Families program stated, \"I didn't realize others cared so much about families they have never met. Heart of the Holidays means so much to me and someday I want to be able to provide Heart of the Holidays gifts for a family in need.\" A Heartfelt Thank You The Heart of the Holidays program thrives because of the incredible generosity of donors and volunteers who make it all possible. Their thoughtful contributions not only meet tangible needs but also fill families with a renewed sense of hope and joy during the holiday season. How You Can Get Involved Want to make this holiday season brighter for a family in need? You can donate to the Heart of the Holidays program and join this heartwarming effort. Together, we can continue to spread love, hope, and holiday cheer. Click here to get involved today! Thank you for helping make the holidays magical for the families in our community.",
