    "slug": "silent-art-auction",
    "excerpt": "...",
    "content": "Silent Art Auction  Bidding is now open! Whether you are attending the 2024 CAPS auction – A Storybook Gala or not, we invite you to participate in the art silent auction or donate. Follow the link to browse silent auction items and enter your information to bid on items. Each item lists a photo, artist, artist description, and description of the art piece. Artwork can be picked up at CAPS or shipped for an additional charge. The silent art auction will be open from August 15th to August 23rd, 2024. The bidding will end 7:30 pm on August 23rd. You will be notified if you have won an item. CLICK HERE to access the silent art auction Please share this link with anyone who wants to support CAPS.  https://one.bidpal.net/2024storybook/browse/2 All proceeds support CAPSs programs that keep child safe and families thrive. If you have questions, please contact us at 574-612-2765 or dev@capselkhart.org.",
